{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/417145082","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/417145082/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/417145082/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/releases/tag/v5.2.1","id":417145082,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOLAFUFM4Y3SD6","tag_name":"v5.2.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"v5.2.1: Require the signed packslip for mise 2026.9.3 and later","draft":false,"immutable":true,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-19T10:05:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:06:31Z","published_at":"2026-10-19T10:05:53Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/tarball/v5.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/zipball/v5.2.1","body":"The action now refuses to install mise 2026.9.3 or later if the release's signed packslip is missing. This closes a gap where verification could be downgraded to the weaker checksum check.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **A missing packslip no longer weakens the check on recent mise releases.** v5.2.0 started checking the mise binary against the release's signed `packslip.sigstore.json`. If that file wasn't found, though, the action quietly fell back to the minisign-signed `SHASUMS256` checksums. Anyone who could hide the file could force the weaker check. Every mise release from 2026.9.3 on includes a packslip, so for those versions a missing bundle now stops the install with an error like this:\n  ```\n  mise v2026.10.11 must ship a signed packslip, but https://github.com/jdx/mise/releases/download/v2026.10.11/packslip.sigstore.json was not found\n  ```\n  Releases before 2026.9.3 don't include a packslip, so they're still checked against the signed checksums. A version string that isn't three dot-separated numbers also requires a packslip. If you set the `sha256` input, it still takes precedence over both checks. A packslip that fails verification still never falls back to the checksums. ([#695](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/pull/695) by @jdx)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/compare/v5.2.0...v5.2.1","mentions_count":1}